# Fusecheck fixture (scripts/fusecheck-check.sh --selftest): the legacy floor
# the FUSED fixture cannot meet. 1 body < min 2 -> fusecheck exits 3 and the
# row is a WARN the run continues through, never a FAIL (the too-few exit is
# never a hard failure).
assert fusecheck-fixtures-fused.stl 2
# Mandatory negative control.
control fused 1
